  ▸ s214-D2 — RULED 256K STAYS THE UNQUALIFIED WALL (2026-08-21, Dave): 256,000 remains the hard wall, unqualified, band or no band. Grounds re-sourced 2026-08-21: no MRCR-style recall figure is published for Fable 5 beyond 256K (Anthropic's 'stays focused across millions of tokens' is launch copy, not a benchmark); every public model's multi-needle recall degrades past 256K; and recall is VERSION-VOLATILE (Opus 4.7 reportedly dropped to ~32% at 1M vs 4.6's ~78% - trade-press figure, the SHAPE is what is leaned on). The recall probe may only ever CLOSE the band, never widen past the wall; widening beyond 256K would require published measurement on the current model, which does not exist. BUDGET_HARD in knowledge/_gauge_tokens.py is untouched by this ruling - it re-confirms the constant.
